  "id": "0474eb5c-a9e6-45aa-b92b-64c65aa5c99c",
  "page_title": "'Customize a model with Azure OpenAI Service and Azure OpenAI Studio'",
  "page_description": "Learn how to create your own custom model with Azure OpenAI Service by using the Azure OpenAI Studio.",
  "page_date": "03/06/2024",
  "chunk_title": "Review the workflow for Azure OpenAI Studio",
  "chunk_content": "Review the workflow for Azure OpenAI Studio  Take a moment to review the fine-tuning workflow for using Azure OpenAI Studio:  1. Prepare your training and validation data. 1. Use the Create custom model wizard in Azure OpenAI Studio to train your custom model.     1. Select a base model.     1. Choose your training data.     1. Optionally, choose your validation data.     1. Optionally, configure advanced options for your fine-tuning job.     1. Review your choices and train your new custom model. 1. Check the status of your custom fine-tuned model. 1. Deploy your custom model for use. 1. Use your custom model. 1. Optionally, analyze your custom model for performance and fit.",
